1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
In an emergency, the first report is often frightened and incomplete.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:14,000
A fluent chatbot can make that worse by inventing facts.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:21,500
Pulse turns ambiguity into a sourced, auditable plan, then stops before action.

4
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:28,000
This is a fictional exercise, not emergency services or medical advice.

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Qwen Cloud interprets the report and chooses the next bounded tool.

6
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:45,500
Deterministic code owns protocols, facility evidence, hashes and approval enforcement.

7
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:54,500
The FastAPI agent runs on Alibaba Function Compute in Singapore.

8
00:00:54,500 --> 00:01:01,500
The protected Next.js proxy signs the report, plan and facility receipt.

9
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:08,000
The fictional Singapore demo uses no browser location, microphone or real call.

10
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:15,500
The fictional report: a cyclist is awake and breathing, but cannot stand.

11
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:23,000
Immediate conservative guidance appears before Qwen starts coordinating.

12
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:31,000
qwen3.7-plus executes four typed, validated tools in strict order.

13
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:40,000
The result includes a selected protocol, real facility IDs and source links.

14
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:48,500
It exposes distance evidence, a plan hash, and authentic Qwen and FC request IDs.

15
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:57,000
Every tool result is canonicalized and SHA-256 hashed.

16
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:05,000
A public listing never proves beds, readiness, capacity or acceptance.

17
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:13,000
Qwen deliberately has no approval or calling tool.

18
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:20,500
Changing facility requires a reason; modified receipts and IDs are rejected.

19
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:28,500
Only separate human approval creates a report-, plan- and facility-bound token.

20
00:02:28,500 --> 00:02:35,500
Five of five cloud scenarios completed the schema-valid four-tool sequence.

21
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:42,500
The evaluation found zero fabricated facility IDs and zero approval tools.

22
00:02:42,500 --> 00:02:48,000
Pulse gives Qwen agency where reasoning helps—and humans accountability where it matters.
